{"ID":0,"CreatedAt":"2026-03-01T15:20:04.8982754+08:00","UpdatedAt":"2026-03-01T15:20:04.8992859+08:00","DeletedAt":null,"script_name":"将两个CRLF替换成一个","type":"codec","content":"# codec plugin\r\n\r\n/*\r\n从网页等地方复制代码时，文本原本的一个换行可能会变成两个换行符，这里将连续出现的两个 CRLF (\\r\\n) 归并成一个 CRLF\r\n\r\nfunc(i: string) string\r\n*/\r\n\r\nhandle = func(origin /*string*/) {\r\n    origin = origin.ReplaceAll(\"\\r\\n\\r\\n\", \"\\r\\n\")\r\n    return origin\r\n}\r\n","level":"","params":"\"null\"","help":"从网页或富文本编辑器复制代码或文字时，常常会出现换行异常——原本一个换行被变成了两个（\\r\\n\\r\\n）。\n该插件用于自动检测并修复此问题，将连续出现的两个 CRLF（\\r\\n）归并成一个，恢复文本正常的换行格式。","author":"ViCrack","tags":"allow-custom-context-menu-execute,allow-custom-http-packet-mutate","ignore":false,"from_local":false,"local_path":"","is_history":false,"force_interactive":false,"from_store":false,"is_general_module":false,"general_module_verbose":"","general_module_key":"","from_git":"","is_batch_script":false,"is_external":false,"enable_plugin_selector":false,"plugin_selector_types":"","online_id":34609,"online_script_name":"将两个CRLF替换成一个","online_contributors":"","online_is_private":false,"user_id":4281,"uuid":"043e8f46-3a44-4630-a680-e13f186a574f","head_img":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18179821?v=4","online_base_url":"https://www.yaklang.com","BaseOnlineId":0,"online_official":false,"online_group":"","is_core_plugin":false,"risk_type":"","risk_detail":"\"null\"","risk_annotation":"","collaborator_info":"","plugin_env_key":"","skip_update":false}